{"id":"n73226-1-6","stage":2,"title":"혹은 · 或者","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73226-1-6-1","ko":"외국에는 얼마나 나가 있을 생각이야?","zh":"你打算在国外待多久？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"외국에는","meaning":"外国","explanation":"외국：外国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"외국","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68121","senseId":"1","lemma":"외국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외국에는","audio":"/audio/4c385d1019784c8c7c63.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"나가","meaning":"出，出去","explanation":"나가다：出，出去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"1","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가","audio":"/audio/2ea9b6f2f116b0039a33.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이야?","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각：想，决定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이야","audio":"/audio/7e27300366f140fc7c3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6ea4544c8e190594","term":"외국","zh":"外国","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3","entryId":"68121","de